+# Parent / Guardian Consent - Early Test of an AI-Assisted Math Practice Tool
+Form version: **pilot-v1**   (record this exact string when you enter the consent in the system)
+
+**What this is.** A very early, unfinished test of a web tool that gives students practice questions on one math topic: **[TOPIC]**. We are testing whether the idea works before building it further. It is not a finished product.
+
+**What your child will do.** A few short supervised practice sessions (about [X] minutes each). The questions come from a set reviewed by **[TEACHER NAME]**. The tool adjusts which question comes next based on how your child is doing. No one outside the adults named below sees your child's work.
+
+**What information is kept.** Your child's name and a login email (or school-issued ID); their answers, scores and progress on this topic; practice streak/points; and any note the teacher records when changing the difficulty. We do not collect photos, voice, location, contacts, or anything else. We do not use this information for advertising, and we do not track your child for any purpose other than the learning shown above. We do not share it with anyone else.
+
+**Who can see it.** [YOUR NAME] and [TEACHER NAME] only.
+
+**Supervision.** A named adult is present during every session. Sessions only happen in that adult's presence.
+
+**Your rights.** You can ask to see your child's information, correct it, withdraw consent, or have it deleted at any time by contacting [NAME, PHONE/EMAIL]. If you withdraw, we stop immediately and delete your child's practice data and anonymise their account. We keep only a record that consent was given and withdrawn. Participation is voluntary; saying no, or stopping later, has no consequence for your child at school.
+
+**How long we keep it.** Until the end of the test ([END DATE]) and then it is deleted, unless you ask us to delete it sooner.
+
+I am the parent/legal guardian of the student named below and I agree to my child taking part.
+
+Student name: ______________________   Class: ______
+Parent/guardian name: ______________________   Relationship: mother / father / legal guardian
+Signature: ______________________   Date: ______________
+Contact (phone/email): ______________________
+
+---
+*Plain-language template, not legal advice. Have a lawyer or a qualified advisor review it for your situation before use, and fill in every [BRACKET].*
